WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:54.090
Someone once said:

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:57.660
There are flowers whose flavors change

00:01:57.660 --> 00:02:00.430
to every color of the rainbow 
with the temperature...

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:07.410
And if you bite into 
their petals with a snap,

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:13.380
piping hot meat juice will come gushing out!

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:17.380
The Colorfried Flowers!

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:24.660
There are mysterious bananas,

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:29.990
that with a single bite turn 
your skin white in an instant,

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:35.130
or dye your lips a pouty red almost 
like you had used makeup...

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:43.610
White Pancake Bananas, and Red Dye Bananas!

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:47.580
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:51.950
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.350
Entrance to the Regal Highlands - Regal Wall

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.350
Regal Highlands

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.350
Devils' Playground

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.350
White Forest

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.350
Black Carpet

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.350
Mushroom Wood

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.350
Ancient Marsh

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.350
No. 1 Gourmet Laboratory

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:57.120
Toriko's group have all gathered 
around the Regal Mammoth.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:57.520
Entrance to the Regal Highlands - Regal Wall

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.690
Coco appeared in the nick of time 
when the Heavy Cliffs were attacking.

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:03.230
Entrance to the Regal Highlands - Regal Wall

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:07.430
Elsewhere, Terry went to prevent Starjun's 
GT Robot from getting any closer,

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:04.230
Devils' Playground

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:09.270
and stands in his way.

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.440
Entrance to the Regal Highlands - Regal Wall

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.440
Regal Highlands

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.440
Devils' Playground

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.440
White Forest

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.440
Black Carpet

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.440
Mushroom Wood

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.440
Ancient Marsh

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.440
No. 1 Gourmet Laboratory

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:14.740
Leaving the fight with the GT 
Robot Gido controls to Coco,

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:17.110
Toriko and the others tried to enter the body

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:19.780
of the Regal Mammoth to find the Jewel Meat,

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:23.050
but they were sucked up instead.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.280
Toriko-san, aren't we...

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.490
...on top of a tooth?!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:39.460
The Threat of Deadly Poison! 
Coco's Formula for Victory!

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:46.240
We're gonna be crushed between its teeth!

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.340
Sunny!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.650
Spatula!

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:06.920
Now! Run down the throat!

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.460
Right!

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:28.880
Peeler Shot!

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:35.420
This bastard saw through all my Peeler Shots!

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.950
What incredible kinetic vision!

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:40.830
Poison Rifle!

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:55.210
But, how?

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:58.480
It's my "Poison Katana" I've perfected

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.450
using blood platelets that have 
a blood hardening function!

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:15.690
Definitely hard...

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:22.270
You think a piddly, half-baked attack 
like that's gonna work, you idiot?!

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.610
That's one extra-scoop of pain!

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:32.940
Sunny, you should've made us 
a cushion with your feelers!

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:35.610
How many kilometers did 
we fall down its gullet?

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.720
Sheesh... Where are we?

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.180
Inside the stomach?

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:48.990
A GT Robot!

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:01.510
My, my... What am I to do?

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:04.310
It's like a maze inside its body.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:09.450
I've wandered back to the 
entrance before I realized it...

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.320
This guy...

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:13.180
Toriko, I'll handle this!

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:17.860
Your nose will be of use 
to find the Jewel Meat

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.720
inside this giant, maze-like body.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.890
Take Rin and the others... Hurry 
while you have the chance!

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:25.460
Sunny...

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.700
Got it... Let's go!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:29.870
But...

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.170
Whatever, just hurry!

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:32.440
Okay.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:35.710
You people are going too?

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:42.750
Run, you two!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.220
R-Right...

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:46.050
It's dangerous!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.990
There are beasts that live deep inside...

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.060
Get a move on, you two!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.030
R-Right!

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:59.400
Thank you very much, Sunny-san.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:04.540
Thanks! Don't let that bastard 
get you even 1 milligram!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:09.040
Don't misunderstand me.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:13.210
I simply have no interest in going 
any deeper inside this body.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:16.280
I will leave that part to you.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:20.250
I will devote myself here to 
beautifully removing this enemy.

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:26.060
Um... He's gone already.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.030
That was fast!

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:33.630
Now then... Would you do 
me a favor and release me?

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:37.670
Release me from these things 
restricting my movement...

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.370
It's my Hair Lock.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.270
I've never encountered something 
that could still move that much.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.310
That's some impressive power.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:48.480
And this might be the first 
time prey has ever escaped

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.250
from right in front of me!

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.950
But in return, I get to beat you!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.860
That guy was strong, wasn't he?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.530
Yeah, he's strong... And not 
just a little bit, either.

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:05.700
You think Sunny-san'll be okay by himself?

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:08.170
Sunny had a reason for sending us on ahead.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.470
A reason?

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:11.340
He intends to fight seriously.

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:15.510
In that case, all we would 
do is get in the way.

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.240
We'd get caught up in it?

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.450
Not quite...

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:24.320
My brother loves beauty above all else.

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:33.990
Thank you for releasing your Hair Lock.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:38.500
Now then... I have one thing I 
want to ask you before I kill you.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.600
Wouldn't you have had more of an advantage

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:42.570
fighting 4 on 1 instead of 1 on 1?

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.270
4 on 1?

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:56.750
You Gourmet Corp. people really don't 
have a proper sense of beauty...

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.580
...or rather none at all!

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:00.220
Beauty?

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.620
Who needs something like that in battle?

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.420
Once it's dead, there's no beauty...

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:06.960
Just trash!

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:07.890
Trash?!

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.730
So it was <i>you</i> who did that?!

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:16.230
Disgusting.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:20.740
You are so disgusting, I can't even laugh.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.840
4 on 1?

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:24.040
Don't get cocky!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.250
I can handle you all by myself, no problem!

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:45.530
The reason I had them go on ahead?

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:47.300
Let me tell you...

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:53.710
When I get serious, something quite 
far from beautiful comes out...

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:56.470
I don't want them to see it!

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:34.280
The ancient king... Battle Wolf.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:06.040
He anticipated the moment 
I'd shoot, and dodged.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.780
That's an excellent reaction.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:10.520
According to the Head Chef,

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:14.620
there are still packs that survive 
somewhere within the Gourmet World,

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:18.590
but I never thought I'd encounter 
one here in the Human World.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.990
Your overwhelming agility 
is as good as they say.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:24.760
Offensive power, defensive power...

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:28.630
I can see that you have combined 
all the skills needed for battle.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:35.970
You use your speed and endurance 
to wait for a chance for victory.

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:39.540
That's an impressive level 
of concentration you have.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:47.720
However I do not have time for 
some pointless staring contest.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:52.390
I must obtain the Jewel Meat before Toriko.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.990
I'll leave the rest to you...

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.800
...Obasaurus.

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:11.940
What's wrong?

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:16.410
Oh... Toriko-san hasn't had 
anything to eat for a while.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:19.080
He ran all the way here without stopping,

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:22.020
so he's probably nearly running on empty.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:24.420
We have to hurry and find the 
Jewel Meat, without delay!

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:25.620
And, huh?

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:27.530
Tina-san?

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:31.130
I can't walk another milligram!

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.210
Hold it right there!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:49.980
Now then... The sensors 
that transmit taste...

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.450
Are they inside that face?

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.960
Peeler Shot!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.100
It wasn't hard enough?

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:07.170
Shoot!

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.500
Shot!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:12.070
Eat this, fool!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.400
Now!

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.970
Poison Rifle!

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:30.660
You shot something into my mouth, didn't you?

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.660
My taste transmissions are being blocked,

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.960
and I've started analyzing the composition!

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:36.260
Poison?!

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:38.060
Impertinent fool.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:41.500
That kind of stuff ain't gonna 
work against a GT Robot!

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:43.470
We'll just see about that.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.870
This is a good location.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.410
I wanted to get here.

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:53.110
We're plenty far away from the 
Mammoth. Here I can go all out.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:56.050
Now, no one...

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:08.560
No one should be anywhere near me!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.450
Don't run away!

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:31.050
Fight me beautifully, 1 on 
1, you disgusting freak!

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.550
What a vulgar bastard,

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:37.790
to do such a terrible thing 
at the Ancient Marsh...

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.230
I ain't running away!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:45.500
I'm just getting out of firing 
range of that disgusting monster!

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.570
That's still called running away!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.740
Hair Leash!

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:07.290
This guy...

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.850
Poison Hell!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.960
I'm a new model robot, you know.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:21.370
I've cleared the test, swimming 
along the Poison Tide.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:23.230
Poison isn't going to work!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.370
The Poison Tide?  The current of death, eh?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.170
Fine then...

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:33.710
Let's just see which is deadlier, 
my poison or the Poison Tide!

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:41.550
Part of my vision and touch sensors' 
transmissions are being blocked!

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:46.560
That's an incredible odor...

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.830
Almost my entire sense of 
smell is being blocked...

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.430
Is this volcanic gas?!

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.060
Hydrogen sulfide.

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:56.370
I produced it by breaking down 
waste matter inside my body,

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:57.870
and then discharged it!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:59.640
Hydrogen sulfide?

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:04.040
A normal human would be dead from 
a concentration of just 0.1%!

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:09.150
You're one fearsome bastard to 
make this much deadly poison.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.180
But too bad for you!

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:15.690
GT Robots were originally designed

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:19.020
to infiltrate places that 
normal humans could not.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:25.860
My titanium alloy won't corrode, 
even from dense volcanic gas!

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:29.800
Out of clever plans, Heavenly King Coco?

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:36.870
And what if I produce an even 
stronger poison than this?

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.480
One that would even melt you to the ground!

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:42.850
You're obviously trying to provoke me.

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:46.650
This gas is combustible.

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:51.460
You're trying to get me to ignite 
it with my attack, aren't you?

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:55.690
Fine then, I'll play right 
into your little plan.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:59.430
First, because that plan 
won't have any effect,

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:03.100
and second, because it'll 
get rid of this annoying gas

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:06.540
so I can see the look on 
your face when I kill you!

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:08.610
Poison Skin!

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:22.790
I'm built rock-solid!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:28.060
Some ignited explosion is hardly 
going to do any damage at all!

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:31.160
You took more damage than me.

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:33.430
Serves you right!

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:35.900
I'm all out of poison...

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:39.140
Now, all that's left is to 
pray to heaven that it works.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:43.470
Seems like the shadow of 
death you saw was your own.

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:45.040
So long.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:58.020
I missed? At this range?!

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:02.590
What's the matter? That's rare 
for such a high performer...

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:04.630
Shut up!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.170
What the...

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.940
Looks like it got through...

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.340
...to the core antenna.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.810
I'm partially blocking your transmissions.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:20.480
I coated the antenna that sends the signals

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:23.680
with my poison to take away 
your sense of balance.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:27.050
A technique to stop electromagnetic 
wave transmissions with poison...

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:32.790
Perhaps I will name it "Poison Jamming"?

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.500
The reason I shot you 
with poison so many times

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:41.970
was to determine the location 
of the source of the EM waves.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.670
Among them, I found the waves that 
transmitted your sense of balance,

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:48.940
and concentrated my poison there.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:53.710
Plus, this is the location 
where the Regal Mammoth fell.

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:55.950
The ground here is considerably uneven.

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:58.650
Hydrogen sulfide is heavier than air.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:02.920
This landscape is best 
for trapping the poison.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:08.090
Even in the slight chance 
the gas got inside the body,

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:10.760
there is no way this body 
would be corroded by...

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:11.800
Inside my body

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:16.970
I created highly concentrated hydrochloric 
and nitric acid which I shot out,

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:19.440
which were vaporized by the explosion.

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:24.040
At the same time, they 
invaded the GT Robot's body.

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:28.880
The two acids went back 
from a gas to a liquid,

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:31.980
and combined together on the core antenna.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.520
The ratio is 3 to 1.

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:42.030
The acidity and corrosiveness of that mixture

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.660
is so powerful it can even dissolve gold.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.900
Its name is... aqua regia!

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:55.210
To think that the GT Robots 
have a weak point...

00:19:55.940 --> 00:20:00.280
The flaw lies not with the robot 
itself, but with you, yourself.

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:02.980
It is because you went 
along with my provocation,

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:07.620
and wanted to strike the 
final blow here and now.

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.490
You really piss me off...

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:29.810
This battle is over. You'd better 
hurry and tell your boss.

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:39.820
This isn't good...

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.650
I used too much poison...

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:49.160
I have to drink some fluids, 
and eat some food, or else...

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:51.060
Damn it...

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:56.930
This is just when I should be hurrying 
to Toriko's group as fast as I can...

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:40.040
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:46.320
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:53.560
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:53.990 --> 00:21:58.500
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:03.630
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:07.010
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:11.480
on a journey with no end!

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:16.410
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:19.580
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:25.560
amid the waves of time.

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:30.400
Gourmet News!

00:22:31.630 --> 00:22:33.200
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:36.630
Regal Mammoth (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 48

00:22:33.460 --> 00:22:36.870
The Regal Mammoth stands 
taller than 1500 meters high!

00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:39.940
Inside its giant body lies the Jewel Meat.

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:41.710
As it sparkles like a jewel,

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:45.010
ancient people used to use 
it instead of a wedding ring!

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:43.510
Regal Mammoth (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 48

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:48.680
And it was proof of someone's strength 
if they got through the ordeal!

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:53.020
I want to find the Jewel Meat and 
propose to someone wonderful, too!

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:58.360
But before I could propose, I 
think I'd probably eat it all!

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:01.830
Regal Mammoth (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 48

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:04.330
And now, on to the next story.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:08.570
Sunny battles a G.T. Robot.

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:11.140
But, even his stamina has it's limits...

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:13.880
Sunny then demonstrates something we've never seen before...

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:17.310
The Unyielding Aesthetic! 
Sunny's Manly Battle!

00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:19.490
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
